  - m_Id: 55
    m_Localized: 'V BLOOD CLAIMED

      <size=26>The Minotaur Warlord has fallen.
      Demo complete - thanks for playing!</size>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56
    m_Localized: 'Reward:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57
    m_Localized: Tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58
    m_Localized: The Hunt
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59
    m_Localized: V Blood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7001
    m_Localized: Awakening
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7101
    m_Localized: You wake from a long slumber. Walk around with WASD to stretch your
      legs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7002
    m_Localized: Taste of Steel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7102
    m_Localized: Click the Left Mouse button to swing your weapon. Click in rhythm
      to chain a combo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7003
    m_Localized: Weapon Arts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7103
    m_Localized: Use your weapon skill. Q and E change with the weapon you wield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7004
    m_Localized: Veil of Blood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7104
    m_Localized: Dash with Veil of Blood. Attacks pass through you while dashing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7005
    m_Localized: Blood Magic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7105
    m_Localized: Cast Chaos Volley. Hitting an Ignited enemy again makes it explode.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7006
    m_Localized: The Merchant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7106
    m_Localized: Talk to the Wandering Merchant beside the camp (or press P) and
      take any item. Everything is free.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7007
    m_Localized: Gatherer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7107
    m_Localized: Strike trees
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7008
    m_Localized: Handiwork
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7108
    m_Localized: Open the crafting menu and make anything. Cloth armor only needs
      Plant Fiber.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7009
    m_Localized: Dressed for the Night
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7109
    m_Localized: Open the inventory and equip a chest armor (Cloth Robe or Reinforced
      Chest).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7010
    m_Localized: A Castle of Your Own
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7110
    m_Localized: Open the build menu and place a Castle Heart (20 Lumber
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7011
    m_Localized: A Place to Rest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7111
    m_Localized: Build a Coffin near your Castle Heart. You will rise there when
      you die.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7012
    m_Localized: First Hunt
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7112
    m_Localized: Medusa Sentinels lurk just north of the camp. Slay 3 of them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7013
    m_Localized: The Feeding
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7113
    m_Localized: Bring an enemy below 25% health
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7014
    m_Localized: Serpents
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7114
    m_Localized: Cobra Snakes shoot from afar in the Ruined Hamlet and the Serpent
      Marsh. Slay 3.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7015
    m_Localized: Copper Age
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7115
    m_Localized: Stronger foes await. Craft copper gear at a Workbench (or take it
      from the merchant) and reach Gear Level 16.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7016
    m_Localized: Troll Ridge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7116
    m_Localized: Cave Trolls roam Troll Ridge far to the north. Beware their charge.
      Slay 3.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7017
    m_Localized: 'V Blood: Minotaur Warlord'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7117
    m_Localized: The Minotaur Warlord rules the arena in the north-east. Defeat it
      - feed on it to claim its V Blood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
